H('418.d.8.A',3,"A house on weak soil is often placed on a slab with thickened edges or on piers. Both are examples of building:","foundation types",["roofing types","window types","siding types"],"Foundation type fits soil and load.")
H('418.d.8.A',4,"A basement foundation extends well below grade, which makes it well suited where the frost line lies:","far down in the ground",["near the surface","absent","irrelevant"],"Footings must go below the frost depth.")
